        <headline>Flood Advisory issued September 24 at 4:21PM AST until September 24 at 4:30PM AST by NWS San Juan PR</headline>
        <description>The Flood Advisory will expire at 430 PM AST this afternoon for a
portion of Puerto Rico, including the following areas, Aguadilla,
Camuy, Isabela, Moca, Quebradillas and San Sebastian.

The heavy rain has ended. Flooding is no longer expected to pose a
threat. Please continue to heed remaining road closures.
</description>
